    {
      "Original": "• Achievements\n• Quests\n• Duty Completion\n• Character Levelup\n• Fish\n• Sightseeing Log\n• Glasses\n• Minions\n• Mounts\n• Orchestrion Rolls\n• Fashion Accessories\n• Other Item Unlocks",
