    {
      "Original": "Session Token Window",
      "Translated": "会话令牌窗口",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow..ctor",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "   !!! MAKE SURE YOU ARE ON THE SAME CHARACTER/ACCOUNT\n   AS YOU ARE LOGGED IN ON IN GAME !!!",
      "Translated": "!!! 请确保你使用的角色/账号\n   与游戏内登录的一致 !!!",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "   !!! NEVER SHARE THIS VALUE WITH ANYONE\n   YES THIS INCLUDES MY PLUGIN TECHNICALLY !!!",
      "Translated": "!!! 切勿将此值分享给任何人\n   是的，严格来说这也包括我的插件 !!!",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " * A LOT of stuff should now show in the Network tab.",
      "Translated": "* 此时网络标签页中应该会显示大量内容。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " * A section should now pop up with the tabs:\n   Headers, Preview, Response, Initiator, Timing, Cookies",
      "Translated": "* 此时应该会弹出一个包含以下标签页的区域：\n   标头、预览、响应、发起程序、计时、Cookie",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " * A weird window now opens up on the side.",
      "Translated": "* 此时侧边会打开一个奇怪的窗口。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " * If you see a ... after the cookie number,\n   drag the tab to the left until it disappears.",
      "Translated": "* 如果你在 Cookie 编号后看到 ...，\n   向左拖动标签页直到它消失。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " * When it opens it should be empty.",
      "Translated": "* 打开时它应该是空的。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "!!! Disable your VPN !!!",
      "Translated": "!!! 请关闭你的 VPN !!!",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "1. Log in to the lodestone.",
      "Translated": "1. 登录 Lodestone。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "2. Right click anything and click inspect element.",
      "Translated": "2. 右键点击任意内容并选择检查元素。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "3. Click the Network tab in that window.",
      "Translated": "3. 在该窗口中点击网络（Network）标签页。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "4. Now click on the quest section on the lodestone.",
      "Translated": "4. 现在点击 Lodestone 上的任务部分。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "5. Scroll to the top of the list and click on 'quest/'.",
      "Translated": "5. 滚动到列表顶部并点击 'quest/'。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "6. Click on the 'Cookies' tab.",
      "Translated": "6. 点击 'Cookie' 标签页。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "7. Find the section that says: 'ldst_sess and copy the value.",
      "Translated": "7. 找到显示 'ldst_sess 的区域并复制其值。",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "8. Now paste the session token into the field 'Session Token' in the 'Acquisition Window'",
      "Translated": "8. 现在将会话令牌粘贴到 '获取窗口' 中的 '会话令牌' 字段中",
      "Context": "SessionTokenWindow.OnDraw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "9. After you are done downloading LOG OUT of the lodestone.\nDon't just click it away LOG OUT! This invalidates your session token.",
